tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent task - auto-derived from input (PR #2964 code review, follow-up to #2956)\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-18\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"3041867cd847d6de4d2c71390570489ee94bc32d65d26373dfb6110b8aad92dd\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPgwKDg\"}"}